## The Protein

Time for substance. First, a hearty Java chunk:

```java
public class Salad {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println("Crunchy, and Crisp.");
    }
}
```

Then a fresh slice of C++ to balance it out:

```cpp
#include <iostream>

int main() {
    std::cout << "mmm so Tender..." << std::endl;
    return 0;
}
```

